.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:6.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Oniric Gamma - For a limited time \(3 Turns\), the Leader aligns itself to the Essence of the Green Constellation, transmitting its glorious radiation \to the entire arena, which penetrating all target's synapses, converting them into an illusion of a world based of all of their best dreams. This illusion affects them by draining their CS in 10% Dif per turn, but giving an Aider Boost of +25% in all Abil\ities. Meanwhile, it heals the SC of all of the priest's Gears by the same amount, and gives a +25% bonus to all of its Properties.</span></p></body>)/Rect[34.2329 27.9704 250.69 85.3216]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj89 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Heretic Conversion - Double Cost. When Activated, the next turn of the Leader will be used to activate the Ability "Heretic Conversion', where any direct type of physical contact transforms the targets into Green Constellation's Monsters.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919211530-03'00')/NM(21be065b538a45e59a8a84bbd5301262)/Page 0/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Heretic Conversion - Double Cost. When Activated, the next turn of the Leader will be used to activate the Ability &quot;Heretic Conversion', where any\ direct type of physical contact transforms the targets into Green Constellation's Monsters.</span></p></body>)/Rect[364.583 31.4802 595.639 83.8784]/Subj