ining mitre. A glowing aura appears to emanate and ooze from their bodies, leaving slight trails behind them.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919210708-03'00')/NM(307836cabaec465cb2dae4cf3ecee1a4)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Cult Leader with ornamented clerical attire with the Green Constellation's symbology and a shining mitre. A glowing aura appears to emanate and ooze fr\om their bodies, leaving slight trails behind them.</span></p></body>)/Rect[432.253 245.505 572.73 339.515]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj130 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(  Extremely Devout and Charismatic.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919205338-03'00')/NM(bb138ce29a0f43518600d4a0c15c9228)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">  Extremely Devout and Charismatic.</span></p></body>)/Rect[220.583 254.257 401.238 288.267]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj131 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(This entity has no defined location and therefore, can never truly be mapped in a consistent, definite manner, and because it doesnêt have a physical structuring, composing only of a phenomenon, it can occur in any galaxy supercluster of the entire univer\se. The entity known as the çGreen Constellationé reveals itself when the formation of some stars, parts of a constellation or not are, in an unknown way, but apparently showing a type of çacquired conscienceé, reposition themselves in a horizontally and \vertically symmetrical manner for the observer, like an asterisk. With this formation, the light they projects takes on a greenish coloring in an impossibly quick fashion, like they are being waken up. Contact with that energy by any sentient living being\ causes collateral effects described by witnesses as an çimmensely deep sleepé, and a consequent çmanifestation of the individualês pleasantest dreamsé. After waking up from it, the victims start to present health improvements, with posterior contact incr\easing the intensity of said effects. As it progress further, the influence of the entity over the victims gets stronger and some changes occur, namely: Secretion and manipulation of a luminous green energy, allegedly linked to the entityês light and poss\ibly being used to convert more members; A constant belief that the astral bodies in space are actually souls, and a subsequent solipsistic çprotagonisté feeling, of being çchosen by Godé and similar lines of thought; Suicidal tendencies, supposedly cause\d by the nameless entity, on the victimsê dreams and, lastly, an unexplained emission of radioactive toxicity from the individualsê bodies, not affecting them negatively, but being noxious to any who approach them and arenêt radioactive themselves. Most o\f its intel is based around its sightings and its effects on observers, many of which, on earth, became members of a cult which reveres these effects as the work of a nameless divine entity. This highly religious aspect diminishes the entityês credibility\ on the online forums due to it creating infamous comparisons to cults about extraterrestrial entities, something that, even in the Fifth Globe War timeline, has a pretty negative reputation and its only accepted by its most fierce followers or people who\ claim to have direct contact with the çGreen Constellationé. )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Arial 8 Tf)/DS(font: Arial,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919210237-03'00')/NM(d7acb930cdb148c288da8a71ac95f1c3)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="text-align:justify;font-family:Arial">This entity has no defined location and therefore, can never truly be mapped in a consistent, definite manner, and because it doesn&#8217;t \have a physical structuring, composing only of a phenomenon, it can occur in any galaxy supercluster of the entire universe. The entity known as the &#8220;Green Constellation&#8221; reveals itself when the formation of some stars, parts of a constellatio\n or not are, in an unknown way, but apparently showing a type of &#8220;acquired conscience&#8221;, reposition themselves in a horizontally and vertically symmetrical manner for the observer, like an asterisk. With this formation, the light they projects\ takes on a greenish coloring in an impossibly quick fashion, like they are being waken up. Contact with that energy by any sentient living being causes collateral effects described by witnesses as an &#8220;immensely deep sleep&#8221;, and a consequent &\#8220;manifestation of the individual&#8217;s pleasantest dreams&#8221;. After waking up from it, the victims start to present health improvements, with posterior contact increasing the intensity of said effects. As it progress further, the influence of t\he entity over the victims gets stronger and some changes occur, namely: Secretion and manipulation of a luminous green energy, allegedly linked to the entity&#8217;s light and possibly being used to convert more members; A constant belief that the astral\ bodies in space are actually souls, and a subsequent solipsistic &#8220;protagonist&#8221; feeling, of being &#8220;chosen by God&#8221; and similar lines of thought; Suicidal tendencies, supposedly caused by the nameless entity, on the victims&#8217; dr\eams and, lastly, an unexplained emission of radioactive toxicity from the individuals&#8217; bodies, not affecting them negatively, but being noxious to any who approach them and aren&#8217;t radioactive themselves. Most of its intel is based around its \sightings and its effects on observers, many of which, on earth, became members of a cult which reveres these effects as the work of a nameless divine entity. This highly religious aspect diminishes the entity&#8217;s credibility on the online forums due \to it creating infamous comparisons to cults about extraterrestrial entities, something that, even in the Fifth Globe War timeline, has a pretty negative reputation and its only accepted by its most fierce followers or people who claim to have direct cont\act with the &#8220;Green Constellation&#8221;. </span></p></body>)/Rect[45.3301 45.264 571.302 206.874]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj132 0 obj<</BS 167 0 R/Contents(  Reveal 3 \(Tarot Cards\))/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919204930-03'00')/NM(b9f8dcac-8f27-4ac4-830c-f36f1b98ec69)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">  Reveal 3 \(Tarot Cards\)</span></p></body>)/Rect[446.729 678.331 573.712 695.035]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj133 0 obj<</BS 166 0 R/Contents(     Spot the Differences)/CreationDate(D:-001-1-1-1-1-1-00'30')/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919204943-03'00')/NM(30dd748e-f486-49b6-afdd-551aa1fa7f37)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">     Spot the Differences</span></p></body>)/Rect[444.402 650.549 571.385 667.253]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj134 0 obj<</BS 165 0 R/Contents(Irrelevant for the Green Stars.)/CreationDate(D:00000000000000Z)/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919210403-03'00')/NM(22879e8246954cbb8b5c368d9179fcba)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">Irrelevant for the Green Stars.</p></body>)/Rect[439.943 421.635 557.675 467.645]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj135 0 obj<</BS 164 0 R/Contents(Be graced with the Green Constellation's infinite presence.)/CreationDate(D:00000000000000Z)/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919210403-03'00')/NM(b71624f192df41c0a2a4f4fcc680dd22)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://w