or:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">   Dr</span></p></body>)/Rect[91.573 135.826 255.145 161.237]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj152 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(   Gs)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 21.8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 21.8pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240922153918-03'00')/NM(68a4a65cfd654867bbac729c25c680b6)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:21.8pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">   Gs</span></p></body>)/Rect[91.573 50.2827 255.145 75.6932]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj153 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Radioactive Manipulation - Makes use of the gift bestowed by the deity to provide to its family and defend them from any threats to their order. It's moves like punches and kicks are naturally blessed with radioactivity, the Partiluxovigon serves as the m\ain minds deterrent, it has a touch that can Isoreveal items and entities, and it can use its staff to attack the targets.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919212222-03'00')/NM(f830e9b47d1b4fc4ba9f423fdb15389f)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Radioactive Manipulation - Makes use of the gift bestowed by the deity to provide to its family and defend them from any threats to their order. It's m\oves like punches and kicks are naturally blessed with radioactivity, the Partiluxovigon serves as the main minds deterrent, it has a touch that can Isoreveal items and entities, and it can use its staff to attack the targets.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 641.802 519.711 711.812]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj154 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Abnormal Strategies - Many aspects of its body and mind are completely taken by the nameless deity, and this connection allows the leader to move in unnatural manners, being able to evade attacks, float, redirect strikes using radioactivity and even absor\bing energy-based strikes.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 9 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 9.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919212540-03'00')/NM(844ec8dc96c74e098e212ff672c9ebf7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Abnormal Strategies - Many aspects of its body and mind are completely taken by the nameless deity, and this connection allows the leader to move in un\natural manners, being able to evade attacks, float, redirect strikes using radioactivity and even absorbing energy-based strikes.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 563.33 517.093 621.34]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj155 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Atomic Deterrents - The techniques assimilated in its coexistence under the orientation of the Green Constellation allows the leader to act as it's hands, creating artifacts to either use or bestow others, and use the techniques normally teached to them t\o have the biggest level of security when battling. Furthermore, the heretics can be used as items to attack the targets. )/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 9 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 9.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919212819-03'00')/NM(c91dd0727aea4492802a48e2eeb56f21)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:9.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Atomic Deterrents - The techniques assimilated in its coexistence under the orientation of the Green Constellation allows the leader to act as it's han\ds, creating artifacts to either use or bestow others, and use the techniques normally teached to them to have the biggest level of security when battling. Furthermore, the heretics can be used as items to attack the targets. </span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 474.447 517.093 537.457]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj156 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Paranormal Body - Constant communion with the deity allows its soul to enter a state of harmony with the deity's soul, giving its body the ability to resist attacks, parry them, become intangible in case dodging doesn't work and convert the energy into sh\ields.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919212951-03'00')/NM(0b13cda8c8ee498badf7f34d2c2a2f89)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Paranormal Body - Constant communion with the deity allows its soul to enter a state of harmony with the deity's soul, giving its body the ability to \resist attacks, parry them, become intangible in case dodging doesn't work and convert the energy into shields.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 372.553 517.093 442.563]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj157 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Astrodivine Vision's Preaching - A submers„o completa na sabedoria oculta fornecida pela divindade permitiu ao lÌder agir como a voz da ConstelaÁ„o Verde, permitindo a ele iluminar as mentes dos membros no contexto Natural \(+10% BÙnus em Habilidade Conhe\cimento Natural e +25% BÙnus na Propriedade SobrevivÍncia\), Religioso \(+10% BÙnus em Habilidade Conhecimento Religioso e +25% BÙnus nas Propriedades InfluÍncia e Conhecimento\) e OntolÛgico\(+10% BÙnus em Habilidade Conhecimento OntolÛgico e +25% BÙnus \na Propriedade Customizada\). TambÈm pode usar a OratÛria Qu‚ntica para desmoralizar inimigos e hereges enquanto exalta os membros e abenÁoados do culto.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 6 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 6.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919212318-03'00')/NM(2383cc0cbc544ff083fa42e90841cde2)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:6.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Astrodivine Vision's Preaching - A submers&#227;o completa na sabedoria oculta fornecida pela divindade permitiu ao l&#237;der agir como a voz da Const\ela&#231;&#227;o Verde, permitindo a ele iluminar as mentes dos membros no contexto Natural \(+10% B&#244;nus em Habilidade Conhecimento Natural e +25% B&#244;nus na Propriedade Sobreviv&#234;ncia\), Religioso \(+10% B&#244;nus em Habilidade Conhecimento \Religioso e +25% B&#244;nus nas Propriedades Influ&#234;ncia e Conhecimento\) e Ontol&#243;gico\(+10% B&#244;nus em Habilidade Conhecimento Ontol&#243;gico e +25% B&#244;nus na Propriedade Customizada\). Tamb&#233;m pode usar a Orat&#243;ria Qu&#226;ntica\ para desmoralizar inimigos e hereges enquanto exalta os membros e aben&#231;oados do culto.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 287.477 520.366 353.087]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj158 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Messiah Syndrome - One of the most common and noticeable collateral effects on any person with a cult leader status' psyche is a heightened sense of protagonism and a self perception as a savior, which can be noticed by their fanatic discourses, a way of \communication and lifestyle based on maxims and absolutes, a special charisma that's made to manipulate the cult members and a level of worship to the deity that echoes and reflects itself through all of the elements that involve the subject.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920115656-03'00')/NM(b7fd72cf7709488ca17aad559ac010e3)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Messiah Syndrome - One of the most common and noticeable collateral effects on any person with a cult leader status' psyche is a heightened sense of pr\otagonism and a self perception as a savior, which can be noticed by their fanatic discourses, a way of communication and lifestyle based on maxims and absolutes, a special charisma that's made to manipulate the cult members and a level of worship to the \deity that echoes and reflects itself through all of the elements that involve the subject.</span></p></body>)/Rect[181.528 212.136 517.748 270.639]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj159 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Radiopsychological Projection -The Cult Leader's Heart is not found inside of its body, as it is the main channel of linking the nameless deity to the material world. Because of that, the organ is found inside of the Idol of Stars, it being the main worsh\ip symbol of all, and allowing the leader to create Mental Alerts, Calming Frequencies, summoning members into the arena through the Idol of Stars' Calling and finally distort the fabric of spacetime for a while \(equivalent to 3 Turns\) to protect itself\ in an Extradimensional Safehouse.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920120422-03'00')/NM(4ad9b17ed327424288eb2d55c9c580e4)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Radiopsychological Projection -The Cult Leader's Heart is not found inside of its body, as it is the main channel of linking the nameless deity to the \material world. Because of that, the organ is found inside of the Idol of Stars, it being the main worship symbol of all, and allowing the leader to create Mental Alerts, Calming Frequencies, summoning members into the arena through the Idol of Stars' Cal\ling and finally distort the fabric of spacetime for a while \(equivalent to 3 Turns\) to protect itself in an Extradimensional Safehouse.</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 117.881 519.711 183.528]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj160 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(Radioactive Blessing - A significantly more refined area than all of the other members due to the radioactive ascension is energy manipulation, with an even stronger radioactive pulse \(Damage x5\), A Rain of Energy Orbs similar to ministars  \(Dif xd20 D\amage\), the capacity to regenerate all Gear at the same time \(20% CS Multigear\) and a Divine Astrobeam which falls from the skies to purify a whole area \(Damage x20\).)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920120740-03'00')/NM(e5d6d6beb785412c93a0ea2c110921d7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Radioactive Blessing - A significantly more refined area than all of the other members due to the radioactive ascension is energy manipulation, with an\ even stronger radioactive pulse \(Damage x5\), A Rain of Energy Orbs similar to ministars  \(Dif xd20 Damage\), the capacity to regenerate all Gear at the same time \(20% CS Multigear\) and a Divine Astrobeam which falls from the skies to purify a whole \area \(Damage x20\).</span></p></body>)/Rect[180.873 22.2832 522.984 87.8932]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj161 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(                                                                                                         Notes\r)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 17.1 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 17.1pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919202839-03'00')/NM(5f15e8eb9fc54a00959a0547e7205bd6)/Page 3/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org